              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this unit contains a SURGEON ACOLYTE model:
- Each time FABIUS BILE completes the Enhance Warriors action,  roll two D3 instead of one D3 when determining the selected unit&apos;s enhancement, and select one of the results.
- The destruction of a SURGEON ACOLYTE model is ignored for the purposes of Morale tests.
- If FABIUS BILE is ever destroyed, this unit&apos;s SURGEON ACOLYTE model is also destroyed.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
