          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;LEGION&gt; NURGLE CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, re-roll a hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
