          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a Morale test is taken for this unit, it is automatically passed.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Sorcerous Master" id="65fa-f2ff-5756-753e" hidden="false">
          <description>Each time a psychic power is manifested by this unit, each time this unit would attempt to perform a psychic action, and each time this unit would Deny the Wtich, measure distances and draw line of sight from this unit&apos;s Aspiring Sorcerer or Scarab Occult Sorcerer model. If enemy units have any abilities that require measuring distance or drawing line of sight to PSYKER units, do so to this unit&apos;s Aspiring Sorcerer or Scarab Occult Sorcerer model.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
