          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, at the start of the Fight phase, the bearer can use this Relic. If it does so, until the end of the phase:
- Add D3 to the Attacks characteristic of the bearer.
- The bearer cannot lose more than 3 wounds this phase. Any wounds that would be lost after that point are not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
