            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Models with a power maul or accursed crozius only. The Cursed Crozius replaces the bearer&apos;s power maul or accursed crozius.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
