          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time an attack is allocated to the bearer, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack ( to a minimum of 1).
- Each time an enemy unit shoots or fights, after it finishes making its attacks, if the bearer lost any wounds as a result of those attacks but was not destroyed, roll one D6: on a 4+, the bearer regains up to D3 wounds lost as a result of those attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
