      <profiles>
        <profile name="Hydra&apos;s Teeth" id="460b-c3e1-55ca-4b54" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Model with a bolt weapon only. When you give a model this Relic, select one bolt weapon that the bearer is equipped with:
- That weapon is considered to be a Relic for all rules purposes.
- Each time the bearer is selected to shoot, you can choose for that weapon to fire a Hydra&apos;s Teeth bolt. If you do so, the bearer can only make one attack with that weapon, but the following rules apply:
	- That attack automatically hits the target.
	- Add 2 to the Strength and Damage characteristics of that attack, and improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 2.
	- Invulnerable saving throws cannot be make against that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
