                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this unit chants a prayer, if this unit contains any DARK DISCIPLES models, add 1 to the dice roll to determine if that prayer is heard. The destruction of Dark Disciple models is ignored for the purposes of Morale tests. If this unit&apos;s DARK APOSTLE model is ever destroyed, all remaining DARK DISCIPLE models in this unit are also destroyed.</characteristic>
