          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Once per battle, if the bearer is selected for an Epic Deed Stratagem, that Stratagem costs 0CP.
- Each time the bearer makes a melee attack, you can re-roll the hit roll.
- At the start of your Command phase, select one &lt;LEGION&gt; CORE unit from your army that is on the battlefield. Until the start of your next Command phase, that unit is considered to be in range of any of the following aura abilities the bearer has: Lord of Chaos, Aspire to Glory, Demagogue.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
