            <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">While the bearer is engaged in Wanton Massacre or Wanton Slaughter, this weapon&apos;s type is changed to Pistol 4. Each time an attack is made with this weapon, on an unmodified hit roll of 6, the target suffers 2 mortal wounds and the attack sequence ends.</characteristic>
