            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time the bearer fights, it makes 2 additional attacks with this weapon. Each time an attack made with this weapon is allocated to an enemy model, that enemy model cannot use any rules to ignore the wounds it loses.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
