            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time the bearer makes a Normal Move or Advances, after the bearer has moved, select one enemy unit it has moved across this phase and roll one D6, subtracting 1 from the result if the enemy unit is a CHARACTER unit: on a 2+, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.
