          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- The bearer has a Save characteristic of 2+.
- Each time an enemy unit shoots or fights and the bearer was selected as the target of any of that unit&apos;s attacks, after that unti has finished making its attacks:
	- Roll one D6 for each wound the bearer lost as a result of those attacks: for each 4+ the attacking unit suffers 1 mortal wound.
	- If the bearer was destroyed by those attacks, before removing it from play, roll one D6: on a 4+, the attacking unit suffers D3 wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
