            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an enemy unit (excluding TITANIC units) within 3&quot; of the bearer is selected to Fall Back, roll one D6: on a 4+, that unit cannot Fall Back this turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
