                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">12&quot;</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: If manifested, select one friendly &lt;LEGION&gt; INFANTRY or &lt;LEGION&gt; CHAOS SPAWN model within 12&quot; of this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, add 2 to the Strength and Attacks characteristic of that model.</characteristic>
