                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: If manifested, select a friendly &lt;LEGION&gt; INFANTRY or &lt;LEGION&gt; CHAOS SPAWN unit within 6&quot; of this PSYKER.
