              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1&quot; to the Movement characteristic of models with this trait and add 1 to the Strength characteristic of models with this trait.
- Each time a model with this trait is destroyed by a melee attack, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6: on a 4+, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making attacks, and is then removed from play. When making these attacks, if any of the destroyed model’s characteristics change as it suffers damage, for the purposes of determining what characteristics on its profile to use, the destroyed model is considered to have 1 wound remaining.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
                  <conditionGroups>
