              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When a friendly WORD BEARERS INFANTRY unit is within 6&quot; of the bearer, each time a melee attack is made against that unit, your opponent cannot re-roll the hit roll, cannot re-roll the wound roll and cannot re-roll the damage roll.</characteristic>
