              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, at the start of any phase, the bearer can activate this Relic. If it does so:
- The bearer regains 3 lost wounds.
- Until the end of the turn, add D3 to the bearer&apos;s Attacks characteristic and add 3&quot; to the range of the bearer&apos;s aura abilities (to a maximum of 9&quot;).</characteristic>
