              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly DAEMON ENGINE model is within 6&quot; of the bearer, each time that model makes an attack that targets a Vehicle model, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.</characteristic>
