              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="f486-147a-28c3-ad93">If this prayer is heard:
- Add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of this PRIEST.
- Improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons (excluding Relics) this model is equipped with by 2.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
