              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="f486-147a-28c3-ad93">If this prayer is heard, select one friendly &lt;LEGION&gt; CORE, &lt;LEGION&gt; CULTISTS or &lt;LEGION&gt; CHARACTER unit within 6&quot; of this PRIEST. Each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack, re-roll a hit roll of 1 and the target does not receive the benefits of cover against that attack.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
