                            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time the bearer fights, after the bearer has resolved all of its attacks, select one enemy unit that was hit as a result of those attacks but was not destroyed. Roll 3D6: if the result is greater than or equal to the Leadership characteristic of that enemy unit, that enemy unit suffers 3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
