                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Ifa Priest model has this Relic, it knows the following prayers in addition to any others it knows: Benediction of Darkness, Litany of Despair, Omen of Potency, Warp-sight Plea, Soultearer Portent, Illusory Supplication (pg 121).</characteristic>
