                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1 to the bearer’s Strength, Toughness, Wounds and Attacks characteristics. 
 - Each time a model in the bearer’s unit makes a melee attack, it is considered to be engaged in Wanton Slaughter (pg 145) for that attack instead of whichever wanton act the rest of your army is engaged in. 
 - The bearer’s unit cannot Fall Back or perform actions.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
